From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: babarot <b4b4r07@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 19:05:09 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Move theme, font size and width into a settings dialog

The header had a toggle for each. A settings dialog behind one gear
button holds them instead, stored together under mo-settings, and makes
room for more settings. The old per-key values are migrated on first
load. The theme gains an Auto choice that follows the OS color scheme,
also when it changes while mo is open.
